				"Steam multiblocks need to be placed in the &b&rsteam inlet compartment to supply steam (the large steam inlet compartment is an item at the end of &cMV &r. If you can't do this now, just use a regular steam inlet compartment)"
				""
				"&bSteam input bus &rand &bSteam output bus &r(enhanced to 16 slots!) can input and output items to multi-steam blocks (steam input bus &ccannot set programming circuit &r, use other input buses/sets if necessary)"
				""
				"Fluids use inlet compartments and outlet compartments; common inlet and outlet compartments may only contain &cone fluid type &r; Ordinary outlet compartments and giant outlet compartments of LV can block the fluid outlet by marking the second slot from top to bottom (drag from JEI, mark with a bucket containing fluid, etc.)"
				""
				"Large steam multiblocks have &664 parallelism &r, &bcan execute LV &rrecipes, and the processing speed is 2 times that of LV machines; non-large steam multiblocks have parallelism &68 &rand &bcan run recipes LV &r"
				""
				"{\"text\":\"The steam multiblock casing can be purchased from the small market.\",\"italic\":\"true\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3E6BC2F76ED6F531\"}}"
				""
